        "comments": "The assembly dmThaAlpi1.1 is based on 73x PacBio data and Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Darwin Tree of Life Project\n(https://www.darwintreeoflife.org/). The assembly process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio assembly generation with Hifiasm, and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial and chloroplast genomes were assembled using OATK. Finally, the primary assembly was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of size. Multiple haplotypic inversions have been observed on chromosome 2 (25.9-29.7 Mbp) and chromosome 5 (22.8-27.2 Mbp).",
